<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Direct on-chain cryptocurrency checkout via Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), and Solana (SOL) at ART STUDIO." />
    <title>Crypto Checkout | ART STUDIO</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --ink: #0a0a0a;
            --ink-soft: #404040;
            --muted: #666666;
            --border: #dcdcdc;
            --card-border: #e5e5e5;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --canvas: #fafafa;
            --gold: #a3702b;
            --gold-bright: #d49653;
            --green: #047857;
            --font-sans: "Plus Jakarta Sans", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            --font-serif: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
            --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            background: var(--surface);
            color: var(--ink);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
        button { font: inherit; }

        .main-wrap {
            max-width: 1280px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 24px 80px;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .breadcrumb {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #737373;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
        .breadcrumb .current { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

        .hero-head {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding-bottom: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .hero-kicker {
            display: block;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3rem);
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1.12;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 0 0 14px;
        }

        .hero-lead {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: #525252;
            margin: 0;
            max-width: 660px;
        }

        .rate-strip {
            background: var(--canvas);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 18px 20px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .rate-strip-title {
            display: block;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            color: #737373;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .rate-rows {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .rate-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ececec;
        }

        .rate-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            padding-bottom: 0;
        }

        .rate-mono {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .checkout-hub-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
            gap: 36px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .network-cards {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .network-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .network-top {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .network-id {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .network-badge {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .network-name {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .network-sub {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--muted);
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .verification-pill {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 10.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .verification-pill.live {
            background: #ecfdf5;
            color: var(--green);
            border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
        }

        .verification-pill.manual {
            background: #fcfaf6;
            color: var(--gold);
            border: 1px solid #e6dcc8;
        }

        .network-desc {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #404040;
            margin: 0 0 14px;
        }

        .addr-box {
            background: var(--canvas);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 12px 14px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .addr-val {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--ink);
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .addr-copy {
            background: none;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 5px 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        .addr-copy:hover {
            border-color: var(--ink);
        }

        .network-cta-row {
            margin-top: 14px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .network-amount {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--ink);
        }

        .select-network-link {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            background: var(--ink);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .select-network-link:hover {
            background: #262626;
        }

        .bag-panel {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 28px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 88px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .bag-panel-title {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            padding-bottom: 14px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        }

        .bag-mini-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            max-height: 260px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .bag-mini-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ececec;
        }

        .bag-mini-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            padding-bottom: 0;
        }

        .bag-mini-item img {
            width: 52px;
            height: 62px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .bag-mini-info {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .bag-mini-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0;
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }

        .bag-mini-sub {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .bag-mini-price {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .summary-line {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #525252;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .summary-line .mono {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--ink);
        }

        .summary-grand {
            padding-top: 14px;
            margin-top: 12px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .summary-grand .mono {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .primary-cta {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background: var(--ink);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .primary-cta:hover { background: #262626; }

        .secondary-links {
            margin-top: 14px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .secondary-pill {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 120px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--canvas);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        .secondary-pill:hover {
            border-color: var(--ink);
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        .empty-bag-box {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #525252;
        }

        .process-steps {
            margin-top: 44px;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            background: var(--canvas);
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .process-steps h2 {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin: 0 0 18px;
        }

        .steps-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .step-item {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 18px;
        }

        .step-num {
            display: block;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .step-item h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .step-item p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #525252;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #111111;
            color: #999999;
            border-top: 1px solid #262626;
            padding: 36px 24px;
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        .footer-inner {
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover { color: #ffffff; }

        @media (max-width: 960px) {
            .hero-head,
            .checkout-hub-grid,
            .steps-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .bag-panel {
                position: static;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body data-cid="<%= cid %>">
    <%- include('partials/site-header') %>

    <main class="main-wrap">
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Archive</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <span class="current">Crypto Checkout</span>
        </nav>

        <section class="hero-head">
            <div>
                <span class="hero-kicker">Direct On-Chain Settlement</span>
                <h1 class="hero-title">Crypto Checkout</h1>
                <p class="hero-lead">
                    Settle fine art, collectible design, and vintage acquisitions directly on-chain via Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), or Solana (SOL). Totals are calculated in USD at live market conversion rates with zero intermediary card holds.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="rate-strip">
                <span class="rate-strip-title">Reference Studio Conversion Rates</span>
                <div class="rate-rows">
                    <div class="rate-row">
                        <span>Bitcoin (BTC)</span>
                        <span class="rate-mono">1 BTC ≈ $<%= formatCurrency(prices.bitcoin) %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rate-row">
                        <span>Ethereum (ETH)</span>
                        <span class="rate-mono">1 ETH ≈ $<%= formatCurrency(prices.ethereum) %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rate-row">
                        <span>Solana (SOL)</span>
                        <span class="rate-mono">1 SOL ≈ $<%= formatCurrency(prices.solana) %></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="checkout-hub-grid">
            <section class="network-cards" aria-label="Supported cryptocurrency networks">
                <% ['bitcoin', 'ethereum', 'solana'].forEach((key) => { const opt = crypto_options[key]; %>
                <article class="network-card">
                    <div class="network-top">
                        <div class="network-id">
                            <span class="network-badge" style="background-color: <%= opt.accentColor %>;"><%= opt.icon %></span>
                            <div>
                                <h2 class="network-name"><%= opt.label %> (<%= opt.symbol %>)</h2>
                                <span class="network-sub"><%= opt.network %></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <% if (key === 'bitcoin') { %>
                            <span class="verification-pill live">Live Mempool.space Listener</span>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <span class="verification-pill manual">Direct Wallet Settlement</span>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>

                    <p class="network-desc">
                        <% if (key === 'bitcoin') { %>
                            Bitcoin transfers are monitored automatically via Mempool.space against the studio deposit address below. Once the incoming transfer is detected in the mempool or confirmed on-chain, your order confirmation slip is unlocked automatically.
                        <% } else if (key === 'ethereum') { %>
                            Send ETH directly on Ethereum Mainnet (ERC-20). Note: automated on-chain listening is currently active for Bitcoin; Ethereum transfers are registered at checkout and verified manually by our Collector Desk before dispatch.
                        <% } else { %>
                            Send SOL directly on Solana Mainnet. Note: automated on-chain listening is currently active for Bitcoin; Solana transfers are registered at checkout and verified manually by our Collector Desk before dispatch.
                        <% } %>
                    </p>

                    <% if (opt.walletAddress) { %>
                    <div class="addr-box">
                        <span class="addr-val" id="hub-wallet-<%= key %>"><%= opt.walletAddress %></span>
                        <button type="button" class="addr-copy" data-copy-id="hub-wallet-<%= key %>">Copy Address</button>
                    </div>
                    <% } %>

                    <% if (cart_items && cart_items.length) { %>
                    <div class="network-cta-row">
                        <span class="network-amount">Bag Total: <%= opt.amount %> <%= opt.symbol %> (≈ $<%= formatCurrency(shipping_details.total) %>)</span>
                        <a href="/checkout?method=<%= key %>" class="select-network-link">Pay with <%= opt.symbol %> →</a>
                    </div>
                    <% } %>
                </article>
                <% }) %>
            </section>

            <aside class="bag-panel">
                <% if (cart_items && cart_items.length) { %>
                    <h2 class="bag-panel-title">Active Shopping Bag (<%= cart_items.reduce((s, i) => s + i.quantity, 0) %>)</h2>

                    <div class="bag-mini-list">
                        <% cart_items.forEach((item) => { %>
                        <div class="bag-mini-item">
                            <img src="<%= item.image %>" alt="<%= item.title %>" referrerPolicy="no-referrer" />
                            <div class="bag-mini-info">
                                <p class="bag-mini-title"><%= item.title %></p>
                                <div class="bag-mini-sub"><%= item.artist %> · Qty <%= item.quantity %></div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="bag-mini-price">$<%= formatCurrency(item.price * item.quantity) %></span>
                        </div>
                        <% }) %>
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-line">
                        <span>Subtotal</span>
                        <span class="mono">$<%= formatCurrency(shipping_details.subtotal) %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-line">
                        <span><%= shipping_details.hasFurniture ? 'White-Glove Furniture Courier' : 'Insured Fine Art Delivery' %></span>
                        <span class="mono" style="<%= shipping_details.shipping === 0 ? 'color: var(--green);' : '' %>">
                            <%= shipping_details.shipping === 0 ? 'FREE' : '$' + formatCurrency(shipping_details.shipping) %>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-grand">
                        <span>Total</span>
                        <span class="mono">$<%= formatCurrency(shipping_details.total) %> USD</span>
                    </div>

                    <a href="/checkout?method=bitcoin" class="primary-cta">Proceed to Crypto Settlement</a>

                    <div class="secondary-links">
                        <a href="/checkout?method=ethereum" class="secondary-pill">Use ETH</a>
                        <a href="/checkout?method=solana" class="secondary-pill">Use SOL</a>
                        <a href="/cart" class="secondary-pill">Edit Bag</a>
                    </div>
                <% } else { %>
                    <h2 class="bag-panel-title">Ready to Acquire</h2>
                    <div class="empty-bag-box">
                        <p style="margin-top: 0;">Your shopping bag is currently empty. Add any painting, print, photograph, sculpture, or vintage furniture piece to calculate your live BTC, ETH, or SOL settlement quote at checkout.</p>
                        <p>Orders of <strong>$1,500 USD or more</strong> automatically receive complimentary insured worldwide courier delivery, including white-glove furniture crating.</p>
                    </div>

                    <a href="/" class="primary-cta">Explore Complete Archive</a>

                    <div class="secondary-links">
                        <a href="/?category=Painting" class="secondary-pill">Paintings</a>
                        <a href="/?category=Furniture" class="secondary-pill">Furniture</a>
                        <a href="/?category=Prints" class="secondary-pill">Prints</a>
                        <a href="/shipping" class="secondary-pill">Shipping Guide</a>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
            </aside>
        </div>

        <section class="process-steps" aria-label="How crypto settlement works">
            <h2>On-Chain Acquisition Workflow</h2>
            <div class="steps-grid">
                <div class="step-item">
                    <span class="step-num">01 · SELECT WORKS</span>
                    <h3>Add to Bag &amp; Review Delivery</h3>
                    <p>Add artworks or vintage design objects to your bag. Orders $1,500+ unlock complimentary worldwide insured courier or white-glove freight delivery.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <span class="step-num">02 · SETTLE ON-CHAIN</span>
                    <h3>Transfer Exact Crypto Quote</h3>
                    <p>Enter your insured delivery address at checkout, choose BTC, ETH, or SOL, and scan the QR code or copy the studio deposit address.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <span class="step-num">03 · CRATING &amp; DISPATCH</span>
                    <h3>Confirmation Slip &amp; COA</h3>
                    <p>Once payment is confirmed, our team prepares archival museum crating, signed Certificate of Authenticity documentation, and insured courier tracking.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-inner">
            <span>© 2026 ART STUDIO. All rights reserved.</span>
            <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer policies">
                <a href="/artists">Meet the Artists</a>
                <a href="/shipping">Shipping &amp; Delivery</a>
                <a href="/authenticity">Authenticity</a>
                <a href="/crypto-checkout">Crypto Checkout</a>
                <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
                <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="/contact">Contact &amp; Support</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy-id]').forEach((btn) => {
            btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
                const target = document.getElementById(btn.dataset.copyId);
                const text = target ? target.textContent.trim() : '';
                if (!text) return;
                try {
                    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
                    const prev = btn.textContent;
                    btn.textContent = 'Copied';
                    setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = prev; }, 1600);
                } catch {
                    // Clipboard permission fallback
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
    <script src="/static/js/cart-sync.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
